  "hindi": "तब तेजस्वी होकर उसने बल से युद्ध में क्रिवि को पराभूत किया; उसने अपनी महिमा से द्यावापृथिवी को भर दिया और आगे बढ़ा। उसने दूसरे को पेट में रखा और वह आगे निकल गया। उस महान् देव, सत्य इन्द्र का वह देव, सत्य इन्दु अनुसरण करे।",
  "english": "Then, full of splendour, by might he overcame Krivi in battle; he filled Heaven and Earth with his greatness and grew forth. He placed another in his belly, and he exceeded forth. May the true drop, a god, attend him, the god, the true Indra.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "Obscure. krivim is left as a name (Krivi); its sense is uncertain. abhi ... abhavat is taken as tmesis 'overcame'. adhatta anyam jaṭhare pra īm aricyata is unclear: 'placed another in his belly' and 'exceeded forth' are literal; what 'another' refers to is not stated. tviṣīmān is printed with nasalised ending (tviṣīmā~) before a. Refrain as in unit 1.",
  "confidence": "low"
 },
